But I wanna snag a moment
to talk to you about

00:19:46.727 --> 00:19:49.146
the importance of nutrition.

00:19:49.146 --> 00:19:51.398
The thing is, most people I know

00:19:51.398 --> 00:19:53.734
actually already know how to eat better

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:57.070
and aspire to incorporate
more whole plants;

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:59.198
more fruits, vegetables, seeds, beans,

00:19:59.198 --> 00:20:01.783
and legumes into their daily routine.

00:20:01.783 --> 00:20:05.162
Sadly, however, without the
kitchen tools and support

